      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Jump to:** [01 Overview](/d/censprobe-01?var-test_id=${test_id}) \u00b7 [02 Blocking Matrix](/d/censprobe-02?var-test_id=${test_id}) \u00b7 [03 Telegram](/d/censprobe-03?var-test_id=${test_id}) \u00b7 [04 Protocol Reachability](/d/censprobe-04?var-test_id=${test_id}) \u00b7 [05 Technique Attribution](/d/censprobe-05?var-test_id=${test_id}) \u00b7 [06 Compare Tests](/d/censprobe-06?var-test_id=${test_id}) \u00b7 [07 Cloudflare & WARP](/d/censprobe-07?var-test_id=${test_id}) \u00b7 [08 QUIC & ECH](/d/censprobe-08?var-test_id=${test_id}) \u00b7 [09 DNS](/d/censprobe-09?var-test_id=${test_id}) \u00b7 [10 TLS](/d/censprobe-10?var-test_id=${test_id}) \u00b7 [11 Matrix Heatmap](/d/censprobe-11-matrix-heatmap?var-test_id=${test_id})"
      }
